autocorrect-safe-autocorrect = Fix unambiguous mistakes automatically
autocorrect-safe-autocorrect-hint = Off by default. When on, only two capitals, repeated spaces, a space before punctuation, and rules you marked automatic are applied. An unknown word is never replaced automatically.
autocorrect-ai-improvement = Offer "Improve text"
autocorrect-ai-improvement-hint = Off by default. The local model proposes a rewrite, you see the difference, and nothing changes until you confirm it.
autocorrect-require-preview-hint = A preview is always required, and an AI change is never applied without your confirmation.
